'''Be an Arrow!''' (Japanese: '''やじるしになって！''' ''Yajirushi ni Natte!'') is the second Japanese opening theme of {{aniseries|BW}}. It debuted in [[BW085]], replacing {{so|Best Wishes!}}. It was also used in [[M15]].

For ''[[Episode N|Best Wishes! Season 2: Episode N]]'', which started with [[BW109]], a remixed version was used, '''[[Be an Arrow!#Opening animation: Version 2 (BW109 – BW122)|Be an Arrow! 2013]]''', which was replaced by [[Summerly Slope]] in [[BW123]].

